# The control for Gurmag Angler delving a Lotus Petal sacrificed for its mana (CR 702.66a, 601.2g-h): with four Lotus
# Petals in the graveyard and one left, sacrificing it for {B} makes five cards to exile for the {6}, one short, so the
# cast is not offered - and would be with mana to spare.

[Bot1 Deck]
Lotus Petal x5
Gurmag Angler
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp x22

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Lotus Petal.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Lotus Petal.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Lotus Petal.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Lotus Petal.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Lotus Petal.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Lotus Petal.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Battlefield.Lotus Petal.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Battlefield.Lotus Petal.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Battlefield.Lotus Petal.Activate(Color: Black)
[Bot1.Main2]
? Bot1.Mana = 
? Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 4
! Bot1.Hand.Gurmag Angler.Cast(Mana: short)
Bot1.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Lotus Petal
Bot1.Hand = Gurmag Angler; Island
